ced values of empathy, generosity, and civic engagement, while motivating me to actively participate in community-driven initiatives for social good.","semester":"6","startDate":"2025-04-13","hoursSpent":10,"description":"Contributed to Project Pustak 2025 by making a voluntary donation to support the education of a government school student through the sponsorship of a stationery kit, as part of a social outreach initiative.","aicteMapping":"Community Service & Social Responsibility","pointsEarned":10,"certificateImage":"https://gsqebbosjbvoeqfxocmu.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/activity-evidence/cadade4b-e197-4e4f-8bf6-a1c56fda5ee4/J3w-zzffDVVk-VVv9JSDB.png","certificateAttached":true,"detailedReportPageNo":"8-9","signatureOfCounsellor":""},{"id":"I0mV5ps5w2Yc__mTB8rei","name":"Buy a T-shirt, Plant a Tree","slNo":5,"place":"RVCE Campus","photos":["https://gsqebbosjbvoeqfxocmu.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/activity-evidence/cadade4b-e197-4e4f-8bf6-a1c56fda5ee4/pX49fn7SqxukAPGK7JQrO.png","https://gsqebbosjbvoeqfxocmu.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/activity-evidence/cadade4b-e197-4e4f-8bf6-a1c56fda5ee4/z4mpQ8YxRDbHY4KAI2bOu.png"],"endDate":"2025-07-07","duration":1,"outcomes":"Through this activity, I developed a greater awareness of environmental conservation and the importance of afforestation in addressing ecological challenges. The experience reinforced a sense of responsibility towards sustainable living and highlighted the impact of small individual actions in protecting the environment. It also encouraged eco-friendly practices and strengthened my commitment to contributing positively towards environmental sustainability. ","semester":"6","startDate":"2025-07-07","hoursSpent":10,"description":"Participated in the ‘Buy a T-shirt, Plant a Tree’ initiative organized by Kannada Sangha, RV College of Engineering, aimed at promoting environmental awareness. As part of the activity, a sapling was planted to encourage sustainability and ecological 