o/storage/v1/object/public/activity-evidence/5f418241-0432-47e8-a2a0-6cb58ae01695/f73E5-Zc14fShOl5orJ2I.jpg","certificateAttached":true,"detailedReportPageNo":"","signatureOfCounsellor":""},{"id":"iMU9uofVFesa-4uKOQJQl","name":"Fist Full","slNo":2,"place":"RVCE","photos":[],"endDate":"2025-11-21","duration":5,"outcomes":"The initiative strengthened values of empathy, sharing, and community service among participants. It created awareness about food security issues and demonstrated how small individual contributions can collectively create a meaningful social impact.","semester":"7","startDate":"2025-11-17","hoursSpent":0,"description":"The collection phase of the “FIST FULL” initiative was launched to promote compassion through small contributions of food grains. The activity encouraged participants to practice kindness and social responsibility through collective community effort.","aicteMapping":"Rotaract Club","pointsEarned":10,"certificateImage":"https://gsqebbosjbvoeqfxocmu.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/activity-evidence/5f418241-0432-47e8-a2a0-6cb58ae01695/V5oII5fe24p9EuehkY-P8.png","certificateAttached":true,"detailedReportPageNo":"","signatureOfCounsellor":""},{"id":"NHc6PzWsFZNim1QNjsSVJ","name":"SDG Photography Competition","slNo":3,"place":"RVCE","photos":[],"endDate":"2025-11-20","duration":6,"outcomes":"Participation enhanced my understanding of SDGs, fostered creative and critical thinking, \\nand encouraged visual storytelling to communicate sustainability messages. It also provided \\na platform to showcase ideas, raise awareness, and inspire peers toward sustainable practices.","semester":"7","startDate":"2025-11-15","hoursSpent":0,"description":"Through the Eyes of YOUth” – SDG Photography Competition\\nI participated in “Through the Eyes of YOUth”, organized by SPARK, the IUCEE-RVCE \\nStudent Chapter. I submitted an original photograph aligned with one of the 17 UN \\nSustainable Development Goals (SDGs), along with a descriptive story explaining its relevance. \\nThe competition encouraged creativity while highlighting sustainability issues and global \\ndevelopment challenges.","aicteMapping":"SPARK IUCEE","pointsEarned":5,"certificateImage":"https://gsqebbosjbvoeqfxocmu.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/activity-evidence/5f418241-0432-47e8-a2a0-6cb58ae01695/VyUOuA9h5kt5LlJK_yxxR.png","certificateAttached":true,"detailedReportPageNo":"","signatureOfCounsellor":""},{"id":"bJIuWYU6ga2s95OOpuHMj","name":"Project Pustak","slNo":5,"place":"RVCE","photos":[],"endDate":"2025-06-15","duration":2,"outcomes":"Participation fostered social responsibility, empathy, and community engagement. It helped \\nraise awareness about educational inequality, encouraged volunteering for social causes, and \\nprovided a rewarding experience by contributing directly to the learning and development of \\nunderprivileged children.","semester":"6","startDate":"2025-06-14","hoursSpent":0,"description":"I participated in Project Pustak, organized by the Rotaract Club of RVCE, which aimed to \\nprovide educational kits to underprivileged children. The kits included essential school supplies, \\nbooks, and learning tools, helping support the education and growth of children in need. \\nMy involvement included contributing to the preparation and distribution of these kits and \\ninteracting with the children.","aicteMapping":"Rotaract","pointsEarned":10,"certificateImage":"https://gsqebbosjbvoeqfxocmu.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/activity-evidence/5f418241-0432-47e8-a2a0-6cb58ae01695/wK2pvKO9sRYrXNMhk65tr.jpeg","certificateAttached":true,"detailedReportPageNo":"","signatureOfCounsellor":""},{"id":"ZKrd7YrRvwUEiAB4HjpMT","name":"Fast Trek","slNo":5,"place":"RVCE","photos":[],"endDate":"2023-02-12","duration":1,"outcomes":"The event enhanced participants’ collaborative skills, sense of responsibility, and active learning through involvement in club activities. It also provided official recognition in the form of activity points, encouraging continued participation and long-term engagement with the club.","semester":"1","startDate":"2023-02-12","hoursSpent":0,"description":"FAST TREK 3.0, conducted on 12th January 2025, was an engaging club event designed to promote teamwork, participation, and active involvement. Participants contributed enthusiastically, earning activity points that recognize their commitment and engagement.","aicteMapping":"Rotaract","pointsEarned":5,"certificateImage":"https://gsqebbosjbvoeqfxocmu.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/activity-evidence/5f418241-0432-47e8-a2a0-6cb58ae01695/TL3WRaiL6YKbCBfkgyMzB.png","certificateAttached":true,"detailedReportPageNo":"","signatureOfCounsellor":""},{"id":"NcsbeIJ2kMxUrtc4f7W-T","name":"SDG Photography Competition","slNo":7,"place":"RVCE","photos":[],"endDate":"2023-08-07","duration":5,"outcomes":"Participation enhanced my understanding of SDGs, fostered creative and critical thinking, \\nand encouraged visual storytelling to communicate sustainability messages. It also provided \\na platform to showcase ideas, raise awareness, and inspire peers toward sustainable practices.","semester":"2","startDate":"2023-08-03","hoursSpent":0,"description":"Through the Eyes of YOUth” – SDG Photography Competition\\nI participated in “Through the Eyes of YOUth”, organized by SPARK, the IUCEE-RVCE \\nStudent Chapter. I submitted an original photograph aligned with one of the 17 UN \\nSustainable Development Goals (SDGs), along with a descriptive story explaining its relevance. \\nThe competition encouraged creativity while highlighting sustainability issues and global \\ndevelopment challenges.","aicteMapping":"SPARK IUCEE","pointsEarned":4,"certificateImage":"https://gsqebbosjbvoeqfxocmu.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/activity-evidence/5f418241-0432-47e8-a2a0-6cb58ae01695/_PCQR9s-VuHRWV9B9W6kh.png","certificateAttached":true,"detailedReportPageNo":"","signatureOfCounsellor":""},{"id":"SW_9wEI_UU0oAU-42o3_6","name":"Paper Drive","slNo":7,"place":"RVCE","photos":[],"endDate":"2023-06-25","duration":2,"outcomes":"The activity increased public awareness about sustainable practices and encouraged the adoption of paper bags over plastic. Volunteers developed communication skills and gained hands-on experience in community engagement and environmental responsibility.","semester":"2","startDate":"2023-06-24","hoursSpent":0,"description":"The Paper Bag Distribution activity focused on promoting eco-friendly alternatives to plastic by distributing reusable paper bags to the public. Volunteers actively interacted with people to spread awareness about reducing plastic usage.","aicteMapping":"Rotaract","pointsEarned":5,"certificateImage":"https://gsqebbosjbvoeqfxocmu.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/activity-evidence/5f418241-0432-47e8-a2a0-6cb58ae01695/lfTkvbmqZ4V_2qOX7Pz43.png","certificateAttached":true,"detailedReportPageNo":"","signatureOfCounsellor":""},{"id":"ONRI93p4wetuY9fd1VfM2","name":"International Biofuel Day","slNo":8,"place":"RVCE","photos":[],"endDate":"2023-08-08","duration":1,"outcomes":"Participants enhanced their research, analytical thinking, and written communication skills. The activity increased awareness about renewable energy sources and motivated students to think responsibly about sustainable solutions for global energy challenges.","semester":"2","startDate":"2023-08-08","hoursSpent":0,"description":"The essay competition was organized to encourage participants to explore the importance of biofuels, their environmental benefits, and future potential. Students expressed innovative ideas and critical perspectives on sustainable energy alternatives.","aicteMapping":"NSS","pointsEarned":3,"certificateImage":"https://gsqebbosjbvoeqfxocmu.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/activity-evidence/5f418241-0432-47e8-a2a0-6cb58ae01695/x3Kiwqskhs_HRd1j3nZSj.png","certificateAttached":true,"detailedReportPageNo":"","signatureOfCounsellor":""},{"id":"aznpTHxnxOf4Jk_NNSfIi","name":"U