SS UTSARGA Marathon 2.0 – 5 km run organized by the NSS unit of the college. The event was conducted with the objective of promoting social responsibility, community service and awareness on social causes through student participation.","aicteMapping":"Social Responsibility and Awareness","pointsEarned":10,"certificateImage":"https://gsqebbosjbvoeqfxocmu.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/activity-evidence/ed85dd32-d01a-44db-ac7c-5cf22bbfa023/xGFWKUheX2eJpFXzx6Awt.jpeg","certificateAttached":true,"detailedReportPageNo":"8-9","signatureOfCounsellor":""},{"id":"gOtSR-p9Ho5NtFHyUEGqi","name":"Blood Donation Camp 2024","slNo":5,"place":"RVCE Campus","photos":["https://gsqebbosjbvoeqfxocmu.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/activity-evidence/ed85dd32-d01a-44db-ac7c-5cf22bbfa023/Up6Zg-j9yEuMxNg0FLOav.jpeg"],"endDate":"2024-06-28","duration":1,"outcomes":"Developed a strong sense of social responsibility and awareness about public health services. Understood the importance of voluntary blood donation in saving lives and encouraging students to participate in community-oriented health initiatives.","semester":"4","startDate":"2024-06-28","hoursSpent":20,"description":"I volunteered and actively participated in the Blood Donation Camp organized at the college campus. The objective of the camp was to support local blood banks and hospitals in meeting emergency medical requirements and to create awareness among students about the importance of voluntary blood donation. I assisted in the registration process and ensured proper coordination with medical staff during the donation drive.","aicteMapping":"Social Service","pointsEarned":10,"certificateImage":"https://gsqebbosjbvoeqfxocmu.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/activity-evidence/ed85dd32-d01a-44db-ac7c-5cf22bbfa023/fddoGky823s4shv_pyLhD.jpg","certificateAttached":true,"detailedReportPageNo":"10-11","signatureOfCounsellor":""},{"id":"KAcHRVmkZ5TAu4Y5Uj9N0","name":"Uptown Junk","slNo":6,"place":"RVCE Campus","photos":